Kaelen exhaled a long cloud of hot, purified energy, feeling his body adjust to his massive stat gains. Every stat was now pushing past **65 points**, with **55 Aetheric Resonance**.
He quickly swept the Broodmother Core, the volatile acid gland, and the chitin plates into his scrap pack.
Near the edge of the dark pool, he picked up three broken, low-grade Hatchling claws, tossed them onto the ground, and dusted off his sleeves.
He triggered **[Void-Step]**, phase-shifting back to the entrance pipe.
By the time Renna, Tobias, and Mina hurried back from the left passage, Kaelen was sitting on a rusted pipe near the junction, holding a broken Hatchling claw with a nervous, breathless grin.
"Kaelen!" Renna ran up, checking him over. "We heard a loud thud from down the reservoir line! Did a pipe collapse?"
"I... I think so," Kaelen stammered meekly, holding out the Hatchling claw. "I saw a few small ones crawling near the edge, but then a heavy concrete beam fell from the ceiling and crushed the whole pipe! I managed to snag this claw from the rubble!"
Tobias took the claw, looking at it in complete shock. "A Tier-D Hatchling claw? Man, even the ceiling is fighting on our team today!"
Renna let out a long breath, patting Kaelen's shoulder with a smile. "Luck or not, you kept watch well, Kaelen. Let's harvest these tags and head back to the extraction gate before Leon Thorne tries to claim this sector."
"Right behind you, Renna," Kaelen muttered softly, falling into step behind her shield.
Under his loose jacket, his upgraded **Obsidian Hard-Plating** hummed beneath his skin, while his scrap pack sagged with high-tier cores and rare loot.
